    "about.privacy_body": "WCC is built for local \/ on-prem installs. It does not phone home, and it does not collect your plant data for anyone else. Tickets, assets, users, and files live in your database on your host. How safe that is depends on your own network, firewall, accounts, and backups — not on a cloud we control, because there isn’t one.",
    "about.privacy_title": "Runs on your machine — your data stays yours",
    "about.release_intro": "Open beta OB1.0.0 — the modules below are built, wired end to end, and exercised on plant-style data. Expect polish as the beta matures.",
    "about.send_email": "Send an email",
    "about.unified_by": "Disatukan oleh",
    "about.view_license": "Lihat lisensi",
    "about.welcome": "Selamat datang di Workshop Control Center (WCC). Ini bukan sekadar perangkat lunak enterprise gendut yang dirancang di ruang rapat—ini CMMS berkinerja tinggi tanpa framework yang ditempa langsung di lantai pabrik. Dibangun oleh teknisi dan insinyur, UNTUK teknisi dan insinyur, WCC membuang beban korporat untuk menghadirkan yang benar-benar penting: kecepatan eksekusi mutlak. Dirancang beroperasi di edge, memecah gatekeeping informasi, menempatkan alat untuk mengelola siklus tiket lengkap, melacak inventaris vital, dan menganalisis KPI real-time di tangan Anda.",
    "about.whats_in": "Apa yang ada di :version (:codename)",
